{"version":1,"content":"<p>網約車平台日後須持有的網約車服務牌照今（30日）午12時截止申請，有4間公司今日到運輸署提交申請，包括滴滴、高德地圖、以及TADA。</p><p>Uber昨日亦已提交申請。</p><p>當局指已接獲8份申請。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:44:50.158575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:11:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.971040+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.645239+00:00","content_hash":"c0ddbf331147eac1d243234e7e3d3b4c41d8e418e931b4bf6391f3af16f5f1a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}